    "body": "> I have had some trouble with fish not displaying pipestatus\r\n\r\nIf you still can't get it to work after a (short) time, could you open an issue on this? I've suspected that fish pipestatus was broken for a while, but I couldn't find anyone to repro for me and I was reluctant to start changing the initscripts without further evidence (since the initscripts are the brittlest and hardest-to-test parts of starship).",
